{
  "id": "moog.subharmonicon",
  "maker": "Moog",
  "model": "Subharmonicon",
  "category": "semi-modular",
  "summary": "A semi-modular polyrhythmic analogue synthesiser: two VCOs each with two subharmonic oscillators, two 4-step sequencers, four rhythm generators, and a 32-point patch bay. Normalled, so it plays without patching. This entry sketches the patch bay rather than reproducing all 32 points. Drawn at the arrangement: oscillators and their subharmonics at the top left, the two polyrhythm sequencers below them, the patch bay down the right. Both four-step sequencers move, which is where its polyrhythms come from.",
